      "fact": "The Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act of 2010, 15 U.S.C. § 78u-6(h)(1)(A), provides whistleblower protection to individuals who provide information to the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) regarding violations of securities laws.",
